{
  "identifier": "tools",
  "description": "The tools window (the tools panel popped out of the main window) may call only the commands the panel uses: the selection summary and applying items to the selected lines, the setup tables, the budget tabs (charges, credits, info, settings, baseline), a line's note and the list of notes, the tag presets and line blocks (saving, applying, inserting and arranging them), and get_view; and send and receive events between the two windows. No file, save, undo or window commands: it passes those keys to the main window.",
